      "source": "NOTE: this annotation cannot be used in conjunction with\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/TestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api\"><code>@TestTemplate</code></a> methods.\nConsequently, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/RepeatedTest.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api\"><code>@RepeatedTest</code></a> and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.params/org/junit/jupiter/params/ParameterizedTest.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.params\"><code>@ParameterizedTest</code></a> methods\nare not supported.",
      "translation": "注意：此注解不能与<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/TestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api\"><code>@TestTemplate</code></a>方法一起使用。因此，<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/RepeatedTest.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api\"><code>@RepeatedTest</code></a>和<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.params/org/junit/jupiter/params/ParameterizedTest.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.params\"><code>@ParameterizedTest</code></a>方法不受支持。",
